{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11103090","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11103090","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1110309001:1":{"text":"...","source_cn":"呼——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDB797FA5279E25B6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1110309002:1":{"text":"How much longer are you going to stand there catching your breath? Don't keep Brutus waiting.","source_cn":"你还要深呼吸到什么时候？难道要让布鲁特斯大人等着你吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6B1B79FEB765F033","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1110309003:1":{"text":"Right! Your moves were spectacular!","source_cn":"我才不会！布鲁特斯大人，您最后一击……相当精彩。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3243B35880331F5C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1110309004:1":{"text":"You have superb battle skills for your age, young man...","source_cn":"年轻人，你的武艺在这个年纪也相当不俗。乌尔氏族的——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCFC3C9BA30CBB3CD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1110309005:1":{"text":"You can call him Soren! And my name is Alsa!","source_cn":"索恩！布鲁特斯大人，他叫索恩！我……我叫阿尔萨！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC15FA2E91B5C73DF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1110309006:1":{"text":"Alsa and Soren... I've heard a lot about you.","source_cn":"阿尔萨和索恩？很好，终于把你们的名字跟脸对上了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x19C0F15429BD00CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1110309007:1":{"text":"You know of us?","source_cn":"您，您知道我们？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E3089A120D9AC86","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1110309008:1":{"text":"Mikola told me everything. You passed the first trial in just one attempt. That hasn't happened in years.","source_cn":"曼卡拉可是隆重地跟我介绍了你们——多年未曾有过，初次参...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC22E0DEB42F2909","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1110309009:1":{"text":"Holy Dusk Lord! Brutus knows our names! Ow! Why did you pinch me? We're not dreaming!","source_cn":"啊啊啊啊！布鲁特斯大人知道我们的名字——嗷！你掐我干嘛...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x07B2D1A8A05C615E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1110309010:1":{"text":"... Sorry, it's just so hard to believe...","source_cn":"……抱歉，只是……这一切，太不像真的了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x94E5775555E5AEF3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:11:1110309010":{"text":"... Sorry, it's just so hard to believe...","source_cn":"……抱歉，只是……这一切，太不像真的了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x94E5775555E5AEF3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1110309011:2":{"text":"Soren, Alsa, you were outnumbered, but you still managed to hold your ground while protecting your clan.","source_cn":"索恩，阿尔萨，刚才那场战斗，你们以寡敌众，还要保护弱小——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x18B51DA0EB8096E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1110309012:1":{"text":"It was not a fair fight, but you didn't back down.","source_cn":"这并不是一场公平的战斗，但你们面对强敌时，从未退缩。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x728FDEB0A3A03B4F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1110309013:1":{"text":"I hope your fighting spirits will also hold true in the Trial of Souls.","source_cn":"那么，在“魂之试炼”中，你们能保持这份坚强吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCAFD712A17EEE859","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1110309014:1":{"text":"Of course, we will not run away, no matter how formidable or terrifying our enemies are.","source_cn":"嗯。无论敌人何等可怕，我们都绝不会临阵脱逃。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x24E0061EBBDD939B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1110309015:1":{"text":"Terrifying...?","source_cn":"哦？可怕的敌人吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C50C6AD61EBAD58","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1110309016:1":{"text":"Am I really that scary?","source_cn":"在你们眼中，我有那么可怕吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0851509F56F76D37","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1110309017:1":{"text":"Wait... Are you saying that you're our opponent?","source_cn":"什么？……布鲁特斯大人，您的意思是——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9F0CF0AD1EDFB2E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1110309018:1":{"text":"That's right. For the <style=\"highlight\">Trial of Souls</style>, you will have to fight me.","source_cn":"啊，没错。你们在<style=highlight>魂之...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE01EE5DD78B8FCF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1110309019:1":{"text":"I'll wait for you at <style=\"highlight\">Heroes' Rest</style> on the day of the trial.","source_cn":"到了试炼之日，我会在<style=highlight>...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x82D9D53C6E90C75A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1110309020:1":{"text":"Out of respect for my old rivals, I'm not going to make it easy. Face me with your true strength.","source_cn":"出于对旧日对手的尊重，我不会放水。拿出你们真正的实力对...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2A4F2D20B22C931B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1110309021:1":{"text":"See you all in three days.","source_cn":"我很期待，三天后见。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7C9EDAFB323AF0EC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:11:0:1":{"text":"Calm down.","source_cn":"冷静点","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xDCC291AB385B2C52","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Calm down.","female":"Calm down.","variant_male_record_index":"63362","variant_female_record_index":"63363","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:11:1:2":{"text":"Keep your cool.","source_cn":"别丢脸","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x097472C8FA19454B","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Keep your cool.","female":"Keep your cool.","variant_male_record_index":"63364","variant_female_record_index":"63365","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:索恩":{"text":"Soren","source":"索恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:阿尔萨":{"text":"Alsa","source":"阿尔萨","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:布鲁特斯":{"text":"Brutus","source":"布鲁特斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":25,"localized_text_count":24,"speaker_count":3}}